{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"unashaminglyme","id":"340062533304057857","is_bot":0,"username":"unashaminglyme"},"author_id":"340062533304057857","channel_id":"850786156479119391","content":"The nameless walks around the park aimlessly, guilt and shame still wracking his mind. He wonders what Irynx and Willow are doing right now, were they already in Niflhel? Have they already confronted Nidhoggur? Should he be doing something right now? He left the group with some rather scathing words, emotions flared up.","created_at":"2021-07-28T03:12:56.752000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869779433857355796","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
